/api.github.com/repos/QuantumGrasshopper/grasshopper3d/contents/CITATION.cff?ref=53731a49cbe24aa3905507ce24d37ccf2afbe389", "patch": "@@ -11,6 +11,8 @@ abstract: >-\n   unit-volume lawn configurations that maximize the discretized grasshopper\n   success probability for a fixed jump distance.\n version: \"1.0.0\"\n+date-released: \"2026-08-28\"\n+doi: \"10.5281/zenodo.22149997\"\n license: GPL-3.0-or-later\n repository-code: \"https://github.com/QuantumGrasshopper/grasshopper3d\"\n keywords:"}, {"sha": "d6574e118c5eaca440b7ecd819e864117e773bdb", "filename": "README.md", "status": "modified", "additions": 2, "deletions": 0, "changes": 2, "blob_url": "https://github.com/QuantumGrasshopper/grasshopper3d/blob/53731a49cbe24aa3905507ce24d37ccf2afbe389/README.md", "raw_url": "https://github.com/QuantumGrasshopper/grasshopper3d/raw/53731a49cbe24aa3905507ce24d37ccf2afbe389/README.md", "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/QuantumGrasshopper/grasshopper3d/contents/README.md?ref=53731a49cbe24aa3905507ce24d37ccf2afbe389", "patch": "@@ -1,5 +1,7 @@\n # Grasshopper3D\n \n+[![DOI](https://zenodo.org/badge/DOI/10.5281/zenodo.22149997.svg)](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22149997)\n+\n Grasshopper3D is a C++ implementation of simulated annealing for the three dimensional Euclidean grasshopper problem on a cubic grid. The lawn has unit volume and is represented by `N` occupied grid cells. The code searches for configurations that maximize the discretized grasshopper success probability for a fixed jump distance `d`.\n \n ## Citation"}]}